  "description": "Chemical Guys Speed Wipe Quick Detailer, Safe for Cars,... - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Chemical Guys Speed Wipe Quick Detailer, Safe for Cars,... - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Chemical Guys Speed Wipe Quick Detailer, Safe for Cars, Trucks, SUVs, Motorcycles, RVs and More, Extra Large 33 fl oz, Cherry Fragrance - Distributed/Packaged by Chemical Guys. Product Details: Speed Wipe Quick Detailer & High Shine Spray Gloss is an enhancing quick detail spray designed to give a static-free mirror shine within minutes. Speed Wipe is 100 percent wash-free, formulated with pure gloss enhancers for a perfect finish. Speed Wipe is designed to repel dust by reducing static adhesion by up to 75 percent. Speed wipe cleans, shines and protects using advanced solar blocking technology. Quickly and easily remove dirt, dust, fingerprints and stains in seconds. Formulated using all new gloss enhancing polymers, Speed Wipe creates an impressive showwinning shine. The streak-free formula works on clear coat and single-stage paintwork for a bright shine on any car. The versatile formula also works great on chrome, polished aluminum, stainless steel and glass surfaces. Speed Wipe leaves your paint with a thin protective layer that adheres with wax and sealant for a smooth, high-gloss shine. The versatile detail spray performs excellently on metal, chrome, stainless steel and even glass. The innovative formula even makes it possible to use Speed Wipe in direct sunlight.",
